<title>PHILIPPINES: RESEARCH ALERT-PLDT rated &quot;sell on rally&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PLDT rated &quot;sell on rally&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Capital Equities Inc recommended on Thursday &quot;a sell on rally&quot; on Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co.</p>
<p>&quot;With more players in the (local) telecommunications industry...and declne in international accounting rates, PLDT's income maybe limited despite a possibility of an increase in local rates and cost reduction due to a 10 percent cut in its work force,&quot; analyst Leila Calderon said in a research paper.</p>
<p>PLDT ended 10 pesos higher at 1,590 at the Philippine Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
